gree that the dating situation has changed a lot?", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le08ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "48000", "text": "Another topic which I've become very interested in is how schools have changed over the years. Does your school have a blackboard and a teacher standing on a dais? Can you choose which classes you sign up for? How have schools changed since your parents were students?\nTell me what you think! <br/><br/>Sally", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le08ob11re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le08ob11re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}], "id": 0}]}